<title>USA: BTG stake of 8.1 pct held by Vinik group.</title>
<headline>BTG stake of 8.1 pct held by Vinik group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by former Magellan Fund manager Jeffrey Vinik said Thursday it had acquired an 8.1 percent stake or 655,700 common shares in BTG Inc, a computer products and services firm in Vienna, Va.</p>
<p>The group said it paid about $12.1 million for the stake and holds it stake for investment. It said bought the shares between November 1 and December 11 at prices ranging from $15.8680 to $20.8995 a share.</p>
<p>It said it holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
